{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45553","headline":"善哉行 · 贯休","name":"善哉行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有美一人兮，婉如青扬。\n识曲别音兮，令姿煌煌。\n绣袂捧琴兮，登君子堂。\n如彼萱草兮，使我忧忘。\n欲赠之以紫玉尺，白银铛，久不见之兮，湘水茫茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}